# (Nothing ignored. manifest.json and manifest.js are generated, but they are
# also part of the deliverable now that marquee.html exists: a static page
# opened from file:// cannot fetch(), so manifest.js has to be sitting on disk
# next to it. Regenerate with `node tools/derive.js --write` and commit the
# result — the `generated` timestamp means every regeneration is a diff, which
# is the price of the page working by double-click.)
